{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb97181bcf36be7ee3f1ae41dd79e47ed9cf65db48f5a8c3ffda8d7467944953",
      "source_sha256": "a3ef99b5302561f5de985dcc87bb1ee2a3c010ffb2f15c812d9bd964d659f37c",
      "translation": "真相之门已关闭，石碑的光芒渐渐消失……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0d5b5eb16956eaf163d9b635e60dac50adfe1d7a9bc2e81a7536a15dc2575b65",
      "source_sha256": "e03e9826a48876de7c2e3f34300e55181aed832deb0f4057776063ed70956236",
      "translation": "东方将伴着雷鸣，卷起变革之风。\\n太阳升起，宣告开始的钟声响起……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6c6768f09ee3513c088954a6fdc4e27bafe69f7ed1c91f9d8194e50dd9289311",
      "source_sha256": "274c9dfed4e4a89642d245d27680d36bb491638fbfbd77a51df1370d6c0522dc",
      "translation": "然而，这片土地的黄昏将招致灭亡。\\n晚霞消逝，便是彻底黑暗的世界……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:53f54ad94ea49b0082126d80ac6c596b98eacbcdc721b99a2fbb621e59f1402d",
      "source_sha256": "b843fc3bfb16e9708ce58a641e31a3deced639198b34bf30e1fec3587926628c",
      "translation": "迷失于混沌者，朝唯一的王所在的北斗前进。\\n踏入呼唤灾祸与救赎的魔城……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6bad82fb191241742775fc5e72b87190c3478bc65e2713739ac672a84bfbc263",
      "source_sha256": "591045150b284d3b73bb96aecd0cf733ca1cf4417fe8b986e99b8260f787460f",
      "translation": "打开中央的门。\\n缅怀英雄的牺牲，感受悠久的历史……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:adbfce480185e81664092e79f565e94a9f1af44be16cd86dec1221d774baf070",
      "source_sha256": "63a0ab89bba42e51eb3e7d795eeaa066ff572e91a78cdd589c4030e798ef307e",
      "translation": "朱特，这段时间真对不起。你一定很辛苦吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:de09e1d927c5bf6c124032aa348cedd3036e1c1cd1f4c6d80fba3753adf4cd03",
      "source_sha256": "f10beb97ee143f79dce49c626a822a53dc6679ba5ce9777c59d9238644f6b33d",
      "translation": "今后，我们一起并肩作战吧。等一切结束，就回风息岛。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2421bf38a7f9ad2125cc520bcffea3e0f8c3f30f9155ed4403d76b68233ba3ae",
      "source_sha256": "468255aad4529f1f0f88838533713c9053266da3f74eed162a18b4163376f8ba",
      "translation": "朱特。新的卡蒙德，已经适应了吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8828ea560c5f655d959a70386f58af30f960c5e92de34fa48a28749fc9d93642",
      "source_sha256": "72909cf358f2ddad6d4a089547c2a434302018c6ee99284e9d1263b5c246556b",
      "translation": "听说，北部军正攻过来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8d7842cceed43548ad1cdfb9c664eb994ad37df567422192cc09506f86a9f371",
      "source_sha256": "ba2130abb4d193585001518f1156b84dd2c5058f7ac2583e1ea5d5192364c6dc",
      "translation": "各位战斗的时候，我会负责治疗伤员。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fda3626d89391b2d278af552078adb76c32e166d6d57b4d64aba7c24b4776bfc",
      "source_sha256": "2462cd328b52d50514913599847c1f768f084c78db40fb7f09c6b0a71af8f2b5",
      "translation": "我有话想对塞蕾丝汀说，她去哪儿了？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f5de6ad80efe011943048fd33472ba9bd06ef334a7d70f63869211e4017bcab",
      "source_sha256": "013705a228014e03994513ff35629c136805b5065293f70bdfd7a2be0c6e4834",
      "translation": "啊，塞蕾丝汀。还记得上次做失败的爱情魔药吗？不久前，我找到了真正的爱情魔药配方。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2861a4449ff5d9efabb407b3c42822ed767bae325bcd6c4ecb3d6e6a40535f02",
      "source_sha256": "b1526ff4e6580122368a10fcd65efce9c450b23bb87f0fdc575c0df4e2f6a60c",
      "translation": "哇，真的，真的吗？？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae2666233eb9fcb86da8c6162ba2a558475a53a2fe6ead861656fd41d76eead7",
      "source_sha256": "cb16432088bfeea3601dc7dd5c7e5506126b8e9cdccc08c5c2244f5f1575e525",
      "translation": "上次教你的时候，漏说了一种材料。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:90851cf756d1d4f9f87c764ba8b06e5c2705464492aa64f693c38b383e3b5191",
      "source_sha256": "b6f21be66d064b19ed3496463ff5cc94df7f5fc3baf47b2f786425e957c0a1a3",
      "translation": "其他材料，可以用我剩下的。你只要把“神奇蘑菇”和“奇怪蘑菇”，各带4个来就行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:873ff756a124d46fff82b55d1607ff593eeae40b32d524681b0fa827670a006d",
      "source_sha256": "531ca3f7415f05ac44ced2bae1ecc051d13865ca1a7b1ce900dbfed19651ca47",
      "translation": "我会等着。等你忙完，再来吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6564de6d6b802a2c2db08d171d59d560c0b1a7811f843a8cd42e615092addef2",
      "source_sha256": "0db3e3306a738a77e32fb7bc065b43ffb266020573996dd5d87b7e01cec36f84",
      "translation": "把“神奇蘑菇”和“毒蘑菇”，各带3个来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5e4f98f52905e474b050db750abbd46b9c9beae51530a011977bee9bb6fb0c0b",
      "source_sha256": "c2e120f6aa4a70bb4d38a70e8a0d43baccc82750b78dfe2dd47d7fe0f1c2c1d2",
      "translation": "把这个这样混在一起，再这样摇一摇……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:09543a4ab0fe4a66dabd31dc2564de284a4badfccac730ea5ec61e9e2362c304",
      "source_sha256": "d4e28880ded1f88214fbbb99a73e5cc2e6fb78ab9286f9e03487c3c0048f1966",
      "translation": "做好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:30cac14eeed49533b8bb2baaa84f7f456801aad8847035dddaca05da544fe50d",
      "source_sha256": "9c24ab4dc4a0a44b5a597b1c7c5b6cf93a7d0d7bcae4f1a502eb5ffb3cde6d87",
      "translation": "咦？！这是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9426d5a444ab709860c6c402ca24d7637c667dc5c93d4ef6c4eea42fc73dd8b5",
      "source_sha256": "b7a0be56b2db7d9bdd466b23a21dddc591e72a268a85b2671d8d2a17fa5daad1",
      "translation": "对不起，塞蕾丝汀。这次，好像又弄错了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:06eb7a33d39ee133bfd3a0d75ee8a58e236e563e5a288e310250fd2a28970a8c",
      "source_sha256": "16d2fb51da4b127bdfe123a870ceb0a57f636ed3b51882e1d609632f3de90d0f",
      "translation": "呜哇，这是什么啊……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:87c426d8ad900077fda305de3748c52fe778c84f03a06bae3ddf560670dbd765",
      "source_sha256": "2c3dfab19241e917d6d5c86201e7024ca8ed5a3d977069d0dd24fb7edf68cd47",
      "translation": "Quest%s: 神奇蘑菇 (%s/%s)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54000fac1db719f438709fedf3a66068d2b82683d07d8605d5ec070cde4b7afb",
      "source_sha256": "c536fe790ae9c056d88109cadb2950d8947d8ac4f331b3ca50896e39e178ff9d",
      "translation": "Quest%s: 毒蘑菇 (%s/%s)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c51cdf279a8bb81b7cb6bbe519cecbedb5f16547d69ae57bb88bf45ec96170f6",
      "source_sha256": "f7368129438694518ecb964f5dc917aca26f8ece5f7f8cc00dc1ad89e4724666",
      "translation": "神奇蘑菇"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a18a5217402071f5a48477f6490c1d8624937bbb134d562fec061f1f965a910c",
      "source_sha256": "a8d6a793c81e0cf20ad439bf31c118a35789c17a296a8c3e984b3e744281aa4a",
      "translation": "毒蘑菇"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a82e3ed006cc139290808bd725a18f7c7cf60290c95fe9ab0590d415b5a4259b",
      "source_sha256": "c6669aa12be90d40d9be3b87047de1d5a979c3a6e8ae4f072190000ae478e6e0",
      "translation": "内斯汀说，要帮忙制作爱情魔药。\\n\\n请各采集5个制作爱情魔药所需的神奇蘑菇和奇怪蘑菇，再回去找内斯汀。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f5f655bedb5bf8cf58cfc878dcf8d33ab3809dfcd3825b29033594de384cccce",
      "source_sha256": "f8482204f0eea34340cf0ce2edf7ed3aa419c103b570a6e8385d3f188ae04adf",
      "translation": "爱情魔药???"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9338e702b97d798bdd1c85e1bf7bd54d8904e60fb67d4ba522fc2a91087c3e99",
      "source_sha256": "08031f0b034f2b875b4c602feef577b3c15725624df2f2eaf5da445527962f75",
      "translation": "我有一件事，想拜托各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e5dd57cac8dd6dc7704e11b02796721eab8b3da9f6bd8c30c8c3939b55301a9",
      "source_sha256": "1b21fc16edf2a878f422610ce3f24042b9a58746299174d69c07ab22bb609a9e",
      "translation": "海底洞窟里，每1年都会涌出一次特别的香源。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e2060570ee9ef114154efe9715d0da8a05dc847de7c66b769220ed1cd18b78bd",
      "source_sha256": "c8dbfef9ca2bdaaf1e3f26d027d0f2bda56cd326c4d3ed76174bffa4f0ddc6fd",
      "translation": "那是一种在其他地方找不到的稀有香料，非常珍贵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:00668a742bf6edce9af6ae29c6af420bba1f9c321a44fedb93f6d1f047db25cd",
      "source_sha256": "41d1cce596a10f9eaf527651961b9f17f8ed97ad1f9c914da50bb04647e97237",
      "translation": "所以，我常去海底洞窟，确认香源有没有涌出。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a9629fd51f4c1c5124f4e492bae15ba572130aa9fff75d3499ea9d61115eee03",
      "source_sha256": "daad7c3858d61c85ecda83575c9a260ccef3694be77e08f6eea0e1d9c7c0c0e4",
      "translation": "今年，我也确认香源已经涌出，正准备采集，佐帕却出现了。我还没来得及采集，就逃了出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7a996126e3716329d2c7959fcaea538ed2657934022535d9909a3bac82a75dc5",
      "source_sha256": "7685894a8b73392760858c63a56a9dc9dc7d44c4d2904ee6d5685999d040808e",
      "translation": "听说各位已经打倒了佐帕，我本该去寻找香料……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8408e4d595dccf4e506a1171aed70d3be1ebc47dbe44b9a9f35066de2717e60b",
      "source_sha256": "f1ef664076d14f25725dd8bbb1099ba1f75a9bdb41be9b752e64ba69a3f2b2d3",
      "translation": "可是，每年佐帕刚消失后，海底洞窟里的怪物，都会比平时更加凶暴，所以我还去不了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be78f5e6dd8ed08158f5f2f393765e0f62f087b033c01194e5856ad7f2f74e82",
      "source_sha256": "4ba256ba69e7f7931eb6e5bdcb735cca96a4e6520b5d6db3506e8983af455dd8",
      "translation": "抱歉，能请各位代替我，到海底洞窟采集香料吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8c416cb1a749c8bd45f29f6b5f1c716ce907f6a8376c70770ccd8d775254101e",
      "source_sha256": "f9e49b372b114e8aa660aedb5146a951574dc2745a17b03d6baccdb61434c6a6",
      "translation": "总共去3处采集香料，就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a4fb29ec66330ee904d70fd0eb602407141b1c2acdbda501c6dfb20ee9083f0a",
      "source_sha256": "cb7797b4e9630453d4ed66186c3a531a83429c2c179bfbb616ecd4258a34d5f6",
      "translation": "再过不久，香料就要消失了，真让人担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:830a99c77784088d79ac4bb075fcc9bba129ec536c5282d6c3a224b0dcdff77d",
      "source_sha256": "f9e49b372b114e8aa660aedb5146a951574dc2745a17b03d6baccdb61434c6a6",
      "translation": "总共去3处采集香料，就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dc2994e1e24fbcfbc0eb7fc9ed0484d89e5badb6eaffa2b6476f5cdbc17e533e",
      "source_sha256": "352ef9c4e23a760adbcd5f77b1c79d8ba317cd1547bbc42f5652054f4525d626",
      "translation": "谢谢各位。多亏你们，今年也能得到这种香料了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d0bc6d3f52bad15f4ccbbac9824a6258bd4149fcf1ec2a70501385702b471f0a",
      "source_sha256": "0597568f10cd118843b8c32770acb636553695b168d1e42e4e9608ded3514552",
      "translation": "请收下这个。虽然微不足道，但应该能帮上忙。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3ae2e0cfa10b454b248e0abdca70b5c01749e4ec86f040a13bc1d10de808a953",
      "source_sha256": "7c348498948f20033883899f8163ae81ba8dd39677a71f909517b2c55605c56d",
      "translation": "Quest%s: 采集海底洞窟香料 (%s/%s)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f89327c6b874058686149837ec2de4570c019d81a7875a4e542e0394ddb04be0",
      "source_sha256": "b73779272bca8461beb5222bb351ade1cec0776008bda8cdd6794826856f5d68",
      "translation": "海底洞窟香料"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:377f39c5e1bd9743d69b8006d93432778369728b7f29b6d3c7c5c3d543932f77",
      "source_sha256": "f53a61c55439219e386efc5c5df38773ee93e48239e6afcceb257e76e92aaa97",
      "translation": "请从海底洞窟采集神秘的香源，带给柯塔马雷的斯维汀。\\n\\n据说，海底洞窟里总共有3处神秘的香源。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:625418ad3a12521539c3b7f7de2e1a699f0d8113acec35ddafde975f777d3223",
      "source_sha256": "b73779272bca8461beb5222bb351ade1cec0776008bda8cdd6794826856f5d68",
      "translation": "海底洞窟香料"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1ae849491aa0357a313e6d3c8fb4518227a5cba285d12f5779833fc3ba2771ba",
      "source_sha256": "f659c123958d537595e6895d4821d6be8abb44cf0be2ec2801882cff0ef2ed43",
      "translation": "我一直在等各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e793f25b5075cb814b1407df6226b27afea46b77493caed13eb22d9003ecc18d",
      "source_sha256": "8eb672edf5f67e6d82afd6a712a0a67fd1a9b19a8f11317d79e1945325a5accd",
      "translation": "族长吩咐，要我制作[终极药]，以助各位一臂之力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3def1e8dda415c385d77913afa2cc9753b26093f783f9987e4e600e3cad99205",
      "source_sha256": "0f8d57fddb1098a9733723392fd06c6a63d9876228393a7acaefc084b2470282",
      "translation": "终极药，是马雷族传统的灵药，效果胜过任何治疗连环术。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:62718dab3f3412bc2a57163fc5400ea4458219bc9a8787266ac7e904eca20b09",
      "source_sha256": "e16fe44c0acda777e169c97e4eea7d47a84a97c87cbade49e700ec12cd28cb36",
      "translation": "其他材料都准备好了，只要找来[软体动物体液]，我就能立刻制作。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:92678075f716e38a01c22616c6ccc60b07628f6c7cf6e0abc47989c58704dedd",
      "source_sha256": "5370e4ac0aa394bdb74009a6bef127204933aa07a36e78487673e590e8150824",
      "translation": "打倒海底洞窟里出现的[地狱鱼]，就能得到软体动物体液。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1d71359e734fb3d4b59b1ccf8fa285a97451dee4f4279e50675100e8ae423018",
      "source_sha256": "27d1caeb6d2269be0f847932b095183617f33784f4d8d14fe5366a8954b4015e",
      "translation": "软体动物体液"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1868dd97d0f1e8602bd73930f2310719e4cea53778e667ea6e5a05645be344c6",
      "source_sha256": "7a6e541b63b6a1f17245f5ebd6c1aefd971581e94eb87b0b77e6982f4f0dca5d",
      "translation": "只要收集5份，应该就够了。 "
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0a0a6b207b23d976698e1f7ad140da0183db1466aee8725c8dde88623eb61ff4",
      "source_sha256": "f4b7c5a8619936e4e91102329469ce91253018196dd0801915ef706f7e952cc2",
      "translation": "打倒海底洞窟里的地狱鱼，就能得到软体动物体液。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:219190751f4d4d28e2e40817c9759e65388e2a3b4822a5d7c7440552c1fc31a5",
      "source_sha256": "e6639de00d48c5a322b8ff57ba5be5d49a6ebf4e74892aac6ba92c27c7e1b3a1",
      "translation": "终极药的效果，真的非常出色。您不需要吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:84e960b0e8f8b9823f1eb7befd5a3d44ff19f96c45475ce62f6d453b43f6c1b6",
      "source_sha256": "f4b7c5a8619936e4e91102329469ce91253018196dd0801915ef706f7e952cc2",
      "translation": "打倒海底洞窟里的地狱鱼，就能得到软体动物体液。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c8df567a100c4b5eef417e7477be556512d0213aaa92356d069aedb477fb179c",
      "source_sha256": "aec0b7e0a8d43bb054076cc424586729db6c684a7fa3f44c3fff77b2aeed7569",
      "translation": "啊，找来了啊。请稍等一下。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eab8b712f1b0035a5b0e8d3aeb623facbe526e6376b839ad3c43b68bfd450ebb",
      "source_sha256": "3d7602f15cb2d8785c9ce843c5fb89e7a6348d5b8830882b5e398758787cc521",
      "translation": "好了，已经完成了。另外，这是族长托我交给各位的东西。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5945e4c2080ffa0793e50847a273deb00e133bcd09869940a88582519b117a2b",
      "source_sha256": "d45c4d879d48c306edb5e6118a62ea32fcd6dd1dd0779f7b63703e42f56dc7f5",
      "translation": "QUEST%s: 软体动物体液 (%s/%s)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3cb1a25b0f654515e7f4458c8db2df9df05b437c853279a323121ae8823e6cd6",
      "source_sha256": "7a11b72f379e486d3a53d1eb30f00ab7479f6693a70110e3c24edc1c3a9e92e8",
      "translation": "软体动物体液"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca651289556a59db16e270198396b702445ce450201d9e3978ca4d344ea88e71",
      "source_sha256": "83075145afa11a160876b778dfc859b802e27081f18e9bf4596d7e9b27a418ff",
      "translation": "对方说，可以为我们制作马雷族秘传的灵药——终极药。\\n请打倒海底洞窟里的[地狱鱼]，\\n收集5份药材[软体动物体液]，再回去找基洛蒂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e13a65dac0af067fc458bceea5ebf019840fd662c8910541207471d25eb501d5",
      "source_sha256": "af0a6e8fbe4392db1f1d88dcd61f52747ad1a077965dddee9ec62c9fc43dbc32",
      "translation": "特别的材料"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:49053a702b4e4cb4ff5d80382fcbae4e1fa97eb8bff0249b238726b48116698e",
      "source_sha256": "74a1ddc28fd7b39da5e3dfd2f1c022f00539817c82ef6635c7accdbf5880aeff",
      "translation": "我正好也在等您。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e38be2ff357a07d3eccaf9937d68a1d38db818bf59fabed2164372a19fa9efd3",
      "source_sha256": "25185ed35688287d19d8317c3cb5378e92968df57a52db4aadc49efa755ffae0",
      "translation": "上次那个盗贼，托我给您带句话。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9f02419179930386ece920fda39ec50745cb19157423e25fc7b11b61a86c11ba",
      "source_sha256": "07c590f96f8a74a7739edf6bcf95ffa0b57524879d9f8c742e1271e1df662916",
      "translation": "他说，[我会在鲁哈尔特高原等着]。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7e878b77c4c40f892f71253e6274ed9095c70f73e334623a821a01b4c03fbe7f",
      "source_sha256": "95148e0460004c0dff3e6438756a73615b24158cb5924b161a7a1121a395886c",
      "translation": "他该不会，是想报上次的仇吧……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b64d351bba829cdef4957eeb5069d827c0689ab1e98051c39c59d18177f5518e",
      "source_sha256": "22b664544c75f5af6ded64ca838e387974d958dbb323d5945540199008297cef",
      "translation": "您要去吗？请务必保重。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4d48cf6978331fc4c04e1abf632a26e2c6eabdf2afa760b231baf55919a7691d",
      "source_sha256": "8d7eea5c0c9435a54878acf96b50f08478d4fdd403b0e33898170ed80c8b65a8",
      "translation": "您想得很周到。遇到这种事，不予理会才是上策。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:291af71a66b4ef1be3181d6dddd155cf6f70b79ed8afef84525c6546add26e84",
      "source_sha256": "a0b8538546d28f6ff3214aa2d8a69bca7303ec6451c72cb4b731aa58fc38d079",
      "translation": "他说，会在鲁哈尔特高原等您。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c4ede378d5b77494c80514a3702db813aae584bb45b2e87ee512c7af5fa600a3",
      "source_sha256": "806a237791c479e44603498c971cce1f931beb3bc40869db656521b7ec04aadd",
      "translation": "你来了啊。看来，你也知道自己犯下了什么罪。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:acb55d22fca9495b5161c1b281e581beab496276660f6e4d2b59ac86cd9bb16e",
      "source_sha256": "037be5cc1cdb8bb1e7909ad57f884d7b4436cea3d67b4559a22fbd2ce274cc41",
      "translation": "这下，我终于能收拾你了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ba95cb8a6362f9686728b3da974775cd9c724a3f8280a38e3ab8f413a89b6a14",
      "source_sha256": "d692677ddaf7c09279982f952cd0982c68dd22262f74ccc794f9a1f6b800096e",
      "translation": "你知道吗？栖息在这里的怪物……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0b0dc5bfbe7288dfa6129eb51be440f2e1da743e7e38a12436ce1d8a59115bfd",
      "source_sha256": "6b04908b2771d10b4e4db88259e9dcab8db1d7b1c59273a08de8d399b97bfe28",
      "translation": "我要让你，去对付这个怪物。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bfd8f8a6ffdcf848c1b26d66c5d00cae54fe7a70bb17107811cdcea1e78ea85a",
      "source_sha256": "3be65efe3a82333d10ca3cbbd619ba000dc5d0df4b6ae4bb624607b0958e47a6",
      "translation": "就和之前在这一带的北部军一样，我也要杀了你！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07128cebac5971c382430c3d0a3789bc42bda874d879c5c6368053a36b2c7abf",
      "source_sha256": "2cfa857444b9a960bde49d0054f86d7d1b75f222db78ab993b3e640c5cc453d1",
      "translation": "对朱特怀恨在心的盗贼，留下了给朱特的口信。\\n请前往[鲁哈尔特高原]与盗贼见面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:94c75aa9151726defbaa4e81a3e1e85fda73e3916e2a471f9ec30e55dea69c63",
      "source_sha256": "0e6473b0d31e1cff5b36f19a758262689912897b9aceee2f29a840c05d53f66b",
      "translation": "盗贼的挑战书"
    },
    {
